12","segments":["¶Then Solomon offered burnt offerings unto the LORD on the altar of the LORD, which he had built before the porch,"],"ref":"II Chronicles 8:12","verse":12,"words":[{"text":"¶Then Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":" offered","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" burnt offerings","strong":"H5930"},{"text":" unto the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" on the altar","strong":"H4196"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", which he had built","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" the porch","strong":"H197"},{"text":","}]},{"id":11359,"title":"II Chronicles 8:13","segments":["Even after a certain rate every day, offering according to the commandment of Moses, on the sabbaths, and on the new moons, and on the solemn feasts, three times in the year, [even] in the feast of unleavened bread, and in the feast of weeks, and in the feast of tabernacles."],"ref":"II Chronicles 8:13","verse":13,"words":[{"text":"Even after a certain rate","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" every day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":", offering","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" according to the commandment","strong":"H4687"},{"text":" of Moses","strong":"H4872"},{"text":", on the sabbaths","strong":"H7676"},{"text":", and on the new moons","strong":"H2320"},{"text":", and on the solemn feasts","strong":"H4150"},{"text":", three","strong":"H7969"},{"text":" times","strong":"H6471"},{"text":" in the year","strong":"H8141"},{"text":", [even] in the feast","strong":"H2282"},{"text":" of unleavened bread","strong":"H4682"},{"text":", and in the feast","strong":"H2282"},{"text":" of weeks","strong":"H7620"},{"text":", and in the feast","strong":"H2282"},{"text":" of tabernacles","strong":"H5521"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11360,"title":"II Chronicles 8:14","segments":["And he appointed, according to the order of David his father, the courses of the priests to their service, and the Levites to their charges, to praise and minister before the priests, as the duty of every day require